# Line endings are normalised to LF in the repository.
#
# This is not cosmetic. The conformance scripts run under bash on Linux, where a
# CRLF shebang line fails with "bad interpreter", and prune.cjs runs inside the
# Linux build container. Checking either out with CRLF on a Windows machine and
# committing it back would break them for everyone else.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary-ish files git should never touch.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
